<title>USA: Grubb &amp; Ellis declines comment on stock move.</title>
<headline>Grubb &amp; Ellis declines comment on stock move.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grubb &amp; Ellis Co said Thursday it has a policy of not commenting on market activity in its common stock.</p>
<p>The statement came after the company was contacted by the New York Stock Exchange because of activity in the stock, the company said.</p>
<p>In early afternoon trade, the real estate management firm was off 1 at 10.  </p>
<p>The stock fell 1-1/4 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
